'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[medium armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
Both the body armor and [[helmet]] can be claimed from the first page of the [[Castellan’s Creed Legendary Warbond|Castellan’s Creed]] Legendary [[Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|45}} and {{Currency|Medals|30}} respectfully.

== Passive Ability ==
{{Armor Passive Info Panel|True Grit}}

== Trivia ==
*This armor is based on Warhammer 40,000 [https://megalodon.jp/2026-1105-2205-52/https://warhammer40k.wiki.gg:443/wiki/Kasrkin Cadian Kasrkin Killteam] armor.  The helmet is modified with additional optics to increase accuracy at range.
*The number 8 in the name of the armor is a reference to the [https://megalodon.jp/2026-1106-0004-08/https://warhammer40k.wiki.gg:443/wiki/Cadian_8th Cadian 8th Regiment], which this armors appearance and paintjob is based on.
*The symbol on the right shoulder pauldron is that of the [https://megalodon.jp/2026-1105-2212-48/https://warhammer40k.wiki.gg:443/wiki/Cadian_Gate Cadian Gate], denoting a large area around [https://megalodon.jp/2026-1105-2154-43/https://warhammer40k.wiki.gg:443/wiki/Cadia Cadia]. The symbol is commonly used as an "honorific badge", showing the Cadian [https://megalodon.jp/2026-1106-0003-46/https://warhammer40k.wiki.gg:443/wiki/Guardsman Guardsman] wearing it fought on Cadia during the time of the [https://megalodon.jp/2026-1106-0003-57/https://warhammer40k.wiki.gg:443/wiki/Black_Crusade Black Crusades].

